&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;a href="https://roman-gardens.github.io/test-drafts/search/?q=vaults">vaults (structural elements)&lt;/a> (&lt;a class="id" target="_blank" href="http://vocab.getty.edu/page/aat/300001324" title="Art and Architecture Thesaurus (Getty)">AAT:300001324&lt;/a>)
&lt;/li>
